21	/**
22	 * Normalizes an owner's optional email address to its canonical lower-cased form. Syntactic
23	 * validation is handled declaratively by the {@code @Email} constraint on the request DTO;
24	 * this normalizer only applies the case transformation once the value is known to be valid.
